+			// Enginehost: the window counts as drawn only once finishDrawing
+			// runs, and Android gives no input focus to a window that has not
+			// drawn. The GL thread runs it after onDrawFrame, and Godot's first
+			// onDrawFrame boots the whole game: a 2.2 GB pack on slow storage
